```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (Server A)
    participant FA as Frontend A
    participant BA as Backend A
    participant BB as Backend B
    
    U->>FA: Search "bob@server-b"
    FA->>FA: Detect federated query (@)
    FA->>BA: GET /api/search?q=bob@server-b
    BA->>BA: Parse: username=bob, server=server-b
    BA->>BA: Query trusted_servers for server-b
    BA->>BA: Sign request with Ed25519
    BA->>BB: GET /api/users/bob<br/>(with X-Server-ID, X-Signature headers)
    BB->>BB: Verify signature<br/>(uses Server A's public key)
    BB->>BB: Query local database for bob
    BB-->>BA: Return public profile
    BA-->>FA: Return federated user data
    FA-->>U: Display Bob's profile
```
